{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — gentle, integrative guidance for whole-person wellness." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --earth-1:#2f3b2f; /* deep forest */
      --earth-2:#6b8a63; /* moss */
      --accent:#a67c52; /* warm clay */
      --muted:#f5efe6; /* parchment */
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --card:#fff;
      --radius:12px;
      --max:1100px;
      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      color:var(--earth-1);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(106,93,61,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0)) fixed;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;background-color:var(--muted);}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;position:relative;}

    /* pattern backdrop (inline SVG) */
    .pattern{
      position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:0.18;pointer-events:none;mix-blend-mode:multiply;
      display:block;
    }
    header.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;z-index:2;position:relative}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1}
    .brand .name{font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    .brand .tag{font-size:12px;color:#5b6a57}
    nav a{color:var(--earth-1);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(166,124,82,0.06), rgba(107,138,99,0.03));padding:28px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius));box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(47,59,47,0.06);position:relative;z-index:1}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    .hero p.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:#465542}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:#6a735f}

    /* card styles */
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(27,32,27,0.06)}

    /* contact form */
    form.contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#4c5a48}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e2dc;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row > *{flex:1}

    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#b5835a);color:white;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:#6b735f;font-size:13px}

    /* sections */
    section{margin-top:22px}
    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
    .benefit{padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(166,124,82,0.03),rgba(107,138,99,0.02));border-radius:10px}

    .process{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .badge{min-width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--earth-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}

    .testimonials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#3f4a3f}

    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}
    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}

    footer{margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(75,84,70,0.08);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .testimonials{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- decorative pattern (unique inline SVG pattern) -->
  <svg class="pattern" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#a67c52" stop-opacity="0.12"/>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#6b8a63" stop-opacity="0.08"/>
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="120" height="120">
        <rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#g1)"/>
        <path d="M0 60 Q30 30 60 60 T120 60" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity="0.06" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="4" fill="#6b8a63" opacity="0.08" />
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="nav" role="banner">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="name">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
      <nav role="navigation" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html">How I Help</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HERO (primary contact + event-series invite) -->
      <section id="hero" class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Let's listen to what your whole system is telling us.</h1>
          <p class="lead">Reach out to explore an integrative, evidence-minded path. We blend time-tested practices with modern assessment — for stress, sleep, digestion, inflammation and balanced energy.</p>
          <p class="meta">Available in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>

          <!-- social proof -->
          <div id="social-proof" class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
            <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px">Community Notes</strong>
            <div class="testimonials">
              <blockquote class="quote">"Gentle guidance that connected dots I couldn't see." — A local patient</blockquote>
              <blockquote class="quote">"Clear explanations, practical steps I could follow between sessions." — Workshop attendee</blockquote>
            </div>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">Testimonials are shared with permission. Results vary by individual; sessions emphasize education and whole-person care.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- contact card / booking form -->
        <aside class="card" aria-label="Contact form">
          <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px">Connect or Reserve</strong>
          <form class="contact" id="contactForm" novalidate>
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />

            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="Optional — e.g. {{PHONE}}" />

            <label for="inquiry">I'm reaching out about</label>
            <select id="inquiry" name="inquiry">
              <option>General question</option>
              <option>Book a consultation</option>
              <option>Event / Series signup</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A few lines about your goals or the event you’re curious about"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <small class="muted">Or visit <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">book page</a></small>
            </div>

            <div id="formFeedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:8px;color:#3f6a43"></div>
          </form>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">We treat information with care. This form is for scheduling and questions only — no emergency care. For urgent concerns call local emergency services.</p>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <!-- BENEFITS (short, poetic) -->
      <section id="benefits" aria-labelledby="benefits-title">
        <h2 id="benefits-title">Where a session can help</h2>
        <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="benefit"><strong>Understand patterns</strong><div class="muted">We look for what repeats — sleep, digestion, stress — and map practical steps.</div></div>
          <div class="benefit"><strong>Small habits, real shifts</strong><div class="muted">Sustainable change comes from thoughtful, incremental practices and clarity.</div></div>
          <div class="benefit"><strong>Education-first care</strong><div class="muted">You leave sessions with clear reasons and simple experiments to try at home.</div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PROCESS (intake, plan, follow-ups, optional labs) -->
      <section id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title" class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h3 id="process-title">How we move forward — an outline</h3>
        <div class="process">
          <div class="step"><div class="badge">1</div><div><strong>Intake & listening</strong><div class="muted">A focused intake to hear symptoms, context, and what matters most to you.</div></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="badge">2</div><div><strong>Collaborative plan</strong><div class="muted">A plan of education, lifestyle steps, and optional modalities that fit your life.</div></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="badge">3</div><div><strong>Optional learning & labs</strong><div class="muted">When useful, we discuss educational lab options to clarify physiology — never required, always explained.</div></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="badge">4</div><div><strong>Follow-ups & adjustment</strong><div class="muted">Short, focused follow-ups to refine steps; the aim is sustainable progress, not a single fix.</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section id="faq" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h3>Questions people often ask</h3>
        <dl class="faq">
          <dt>Do you guarantee results?</dt>
          <dd class="muted">No guaranteed cures. Our work emphasizes education and individualized plans; outcomes vary with many factors.</dd>

          <dt>Are labs required?</dt>
          <dd class="muted">No — labs are optional and pursued when they can clarify next steps. We explain benefits and limits before any testing.</dd>

          <dt>Can I attend events instead of a consult?</dt>
          <dd class="muted">Events and series are educational and supportive; they complement but do not replace personalized medical advice.</dd>

          <dt>How do I cancel or reschedule?</dt>
          <dd class="muted">Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>. We’ll do our best to accommodate changes.</dd>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <!-- LEAD MAGNET (event series sign-up) -->
      <section id="lead-magnet" class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h3>Join a short series — learn practical steps</h3>
        <div class="lead-magnet">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <p class="muted">Sign up for an upcoming small-group series: three evenings of focused education, guided practice, and time for questions. Intended for people curious about holistic, actionable strategies.</p>
          </div>
          <form id="miniSignup" style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <input type="email" id="leadEmail" placeholder="Your email" required style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e2dc" />
            <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="subscribe()">Reserve spot</button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">We’ll email event details and a short worksheet. We respect your privacy.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- FINAL CTA -->
      <section id="final-cta" style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
          <strong style="font-size:16px">Ready to begin?</strong>
          <div class="muted">Book a time, ask a question, or join a series — start with one careful step.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div class="muted">Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      var fb = document.getElementById('formFeedback');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(ev){
        ev.preventDefault();
        var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        if(!name || !email){ fb.textContent = 'Please provide name and email.'; return; }
        fb.textContent = 'Thanks — your message is received. We typically respond within 2 business days.';
        form.reset();
      });
    })();

    function subscribe(){
      var e = document.getElementById('leadEmail');
      if(!e.value){ alert('Please add an email.'); return; }
      alert('Thank you — we will email event details.');
      e.value='';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}

This chunk contains the contact page and a short README for the Holistic / Integrative Medicine site.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — the contact/connect page with all required sections: hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, cta.

Key notes
- Visuals are achieved with CSS (gradients, earthy color vars) and a unique inline SVG pattern. No external images, fonts, or CDNs are used.
- The page includes accessible form controls, aria attributes, and small client-side validation. Forms simulate submission locally — integrate with your backend or email provider as needed.
- Placeholders to replace during build or runtime: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}.

Development / Testing
1. Place this file alongside the other site pages (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).
2. Open contact.html in a browser. The page is self-contained; the SVG pattern is inline and the layout adapts for smaller viewports.
3. Hook up form handling by replacing the simulated submit handler in the script with real POST/XHR/fetch logic.

Content Guidance
- The copy avoids promises of cures, focuses on education, whole-person care, and optional lab discussion. It is intentionally minimal and poetic.
- The process section describes intake, plan, optional labs (educational), and follow-ups as required by the project rules.

Accessibility & Performance
- Form fields include labels and the success message uses aria-live for assistive tech.
- The decorative SVG has aria-hidden set and uses low opacity to keep contrast for content.

Styling details
- Color palette leans "earthy_warm" with deep greens, moss, and warm clay accent.
- Rounded cards, soft shadows, and subtle gradients aim for an inviting, calm aesthetic.

If you need a separate assets SVG file, the inline SVG in the page can be extracted into assets/img/pattern.svg and referenced as a background-image data URI or via <img>. However, this build keeps it inline to conform with the constraint of no external assets in this chunk.

Contact
- For further tweaks to voice, layout, or responsive behavior, edit contact.html directly. Replace placeholders during your deployment step.

"} 
